recommend keep-going the marketplace loop is closed on glass (catalog, row, page, search, tap-to-open); next agent-doable is a part detail page painted from a tapped PartRef (picture beside full facts), a query header above the shelf showing the typed clauses and N results, or another Season-A / double-seat journey
